%% Transfer a ticket
%% Curated product flow. Grounded in Trailmark-derived graphs and the current UI.
%% Trail of Bits skill:
%% https://github.com/trailofbits/skills/blob/main/plugins/trailmark/skills/diagramming-code/SKILL.md
%% Derived graphs:
%% - docs/flows/derived/app-ticket-vault.mmd (TicketVault)
%% - apps/sezs/src/event/TicketVault.tsx (Keep a copy for this device, Send copy)
%% - apps/sezs/pages/ticket.tsx
%% Gaps:
%% - Transfer is a sealed copy via ZID, not a chain move of the nullifier.
%% - The door intent of TicketVault hides the transfer fields.
flowchart TB

    TicketPage["pages/ticket.tsx · Ticket"]:::web --> Vault["TicketVault intent=full"]:::web
    Vault --> Seal["Select Keep a copy for this device"]:::web
    Seal --> Passkey["Confirm the passkey prompt"]:::wallet
    Vault --> Friend["Enter Friend ZID pubkey"]:::web
    Friend --> Send["Select Send copy"]:::web
    Send --> Envelope["postEnvelope / fetchEnvelopes"]:::web
    OpenQr["Select Open QR"]:::web --> DoorQr["TicketQr label Door ticket"]:::web

